            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "G. When it becomes necessary to close a school or work location because of weather or for other reasons as deemed necessary by the Superintendent or his designee, both parties agree that the days lost shall be made up by extending the school year as determined by the Board for that school or work location, after consultation with the Association.",
